  "_bus": "The spacecraft's own needs. bus_power = bus_w_per_size * type size (W, always on); at night only night_idle of it runs, plus the heaters on a cold target. mass_allowance: kg of modules the type's bus carries (missions.json size x allowance_per_size, at least allowance_min). Battery-only types (short flights) run on their batteries: need = power x battery_hours.",
  "bus": {"bus_w_per_size": 8.0, "night_idle": 0.25, "allowance_per_size": 70.0, "allowance_min": 30.0,
    "battery_only": ["sounding", "impactor"], "battery_hours": 1.0, "storage_weeks": 1.5,
    "allowance_type": {"sounding": 30, "demo_sat": 50, "comms": 70, "crewed_flight": 60, "crewed_landing": 90, "base_module": 160, "isru": 150}},
  "_gauges": "Six gauges (GDD 7): green when the margin >= green, yellow from yellow, red below (or negative). Red mass, energy or budget blocks the plan; red data or comms only warns (data is lost).",
  "gauges": {
    "order": ["mass", "energy", "data", "comms", "budget", "time"],
    "green": 0.2,
    "yellow": 0.05,
    "blocking": ["mass", "energy", "budget"]
  },
  "_env": "Environment of each target. sun: sunlight factor on panels; night: dark time the batteries must cover (orbit eclipse ~0.6, a lunar night 12); cold: needs a heater or an RTG at night. hidden: facts the agency does not know until it flies there (or a tech / Cometling reveals them): until then the planner assumes 'assumed'.",
  "assumed": {"sun": 1.0, "night": 0.6, "cold": false},
  "env": {
    "suborbital":    {"sun": 1.0,  "night": 0.0, "cold": false, "hidden": []},
    "leo":           {"sun": 1.0,  "night": 0.6, "cold": false, "hidden": []},
    "sso":           {"sun": 1.0,  "night": 0.1, "cold": false, "hidden": ["night"]},
    "geo":           {"sun": 1.0,  "night": 0.2, "cold": false, "hidden": []},
    "lunar_flyby":   {"sun": 1.0,  "night": 0.1, "cold": false, "hidden": []},
    "lunar_orbit":   {"sun": 1.0,  "night": 0.8, "cold": false, "hidden": []},
    "lunar_surface": {"sun": 1.0,  "night": 12.0, "cold": true, "hidden": ["night", "cold"]},
    "lunar_pole":    {"sun": 0.5,  "night": 4.0, "cold": true, "hidden": ["sun", "night", "cold"]},
    "comet":         {"sun": 0.4,  "night": 2.0, "cold": true, "hidden": ["sun", "night", "cold"]}
  },
  "_reveal": "Techs that reveal facts before the first flight: env (targets whose hidden environment becomes known), ratio (mission types whose ideal balance shows in the journal).",
